    <td style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">preparing an annual report
    on executive compensation that the SEC requires in the Post-Combination Company&#8217;s annual proxy statement; and</span></td></tr>
