following table sets forth information regarding the beneficial ownership of our ordinary shares as of December 1, 2025, based
on information obtained from the persons named below, with respect to the beneficial ownership of our ordinary shares, by:</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

