were unsecured. For the three and nine months ended September 30, 2025, total amortized debt discount of $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium_c20250701__20250930__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--DecemberThirtyFirstTwoThousandTwentyFourMember_zr9taa4HltMd" title="Amortized debt discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium" contextRef="From2025-07-012025-09-30_custom_DecemberThirtyFirstTwoThousandTwentyFourMember" id="Fact001633" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">19,476</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_90A_eus-gaap--AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium_c20250101__20250930__us-gaap--AwardDateAxis__custom--DecemberThirtyFirstTwoThousandTwentyFourMember_zAfUPHSrvVX8" title="Amortized debt discount"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:AmortizationOfDebtDiscountPremium" contextRef="From2025-01-012025-09-30_custom_DecemberThirtyFirstTwoThousandTwentyFourMember" id="Fact001635" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">46,646</ix:nonFraction></span> was included
