September 30, 2025 and December 31, 2024, total balance of $<span id="xdx_904_eus-gaap--NotesPayableCurrent_iI_c20250930__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_zsx8nrLKBzz7" title="Notes payable, current"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2025-09-30_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact001682" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">885,564</ix:nonFraction></span> and $<span id="xdx_903_eus-gaap--NotesPayableCurrent_iI_c20241231__us-gaap--RelatedPartyTransactionsByRelatedPartyAxis__us-gaap--RelatedPartyMember_z28FGHNS1dJf" title="Notes payable, current"><ix:nonFraction name="us-gaap:NotesPayableCurrent" contextRef="AsOf2024-12-31_us-gaap_RelatedPartyMember" id="Fact001684" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" decimals="0" unitRef="USD">1,266,832</ix:nonFraction></span> inclusive of unamortized debt discount is included
in Notes payable &#8211; related party on the accompanying condensed consolidated balance sheet.</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">&#160;</span></p>

